# drag-k (plan section 6, M7): k's number box dragged. Its box is (330, 452.5, 107 x 32) at
# 1440 x 900 in the reference's DOM; the press at its centre (383, 468) travels 3 px before it
# drags, then 0.02 a px from the press (scrub.ts), so +50 px holds k at 1.00, the button still
# down: the row's band, the box's 2 px stroke on k's 18 % tint, the value in --foreground, ↺ kept
# out of the row while it is held, and under the row the ruler (4 px down, as wide as the row),
# its tape in k's colours with 1.00 under the index.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 468
wait 16
down
move 433 468 over 160
wait 300
shot drag-k
